boss.exampleApi:
POST /v1/links {longUrl, alias?, expiresAt?} (Idempotency-Key) -> 201 {code, shortUrl}
GET /{code} -> 302 Location: longUrl (301 if analytics are not needed)
DELETE /v1/links/{code} (owner only)

POST /v1/pastes {content, syntax?, expiresIn?} -> 201 {id, url}
GET /v1/pastes/{id} -> metadata + content URL (404 after expiry)
GET /raw/{id} -> text/plain from CDN

Gateway check: allow(key=user|ip|apiKey, rule) -> {allowed, remaining, resetAt}
Denied response: 429 Too Many Requests + Retry-After + X-RateLimit-* headers
PUT /v1/rules/{id} {limit, window, scope} (admin)

PUT /v1/kv/{key} {value, context?} (W=2 of 3) -> 200 {version}
GET /v1/kv/{key} (R=2 of 3) -> value(s) + version vector
DELETE /v1/kv/{key} -> tombstone

POST /v1/notifications {userId, template, data, channels?, idempotencyKey} -> 202
PUT /v1/users/{id}/preferences {push, sms, email, quietHours}
Provider webhooks: POST /v1/receipts/{provider} (delivered/failed)

POST /v1/posts {text, mediaIds?} -> 201 {postId}
GET /v1/feed?cursor= -> ranked page of posts
POST /v1/posts/{id}/likes, POST /v1/posts/{id}/comments

POST /v1/tweets {text} (Idempotency-Key) -> 201 {tweetId}
POST /v1/follows {targetUserId}
GET /v1/timeline/home?cursor= -> tweets

WebSocket: send {clientMsgId, to|groupId, ciphertext} -> ack {serverSeq}
Server push: message, delivered, read receipts
GET /v1/chats/{id}/messages?afterSeq= (sync after reconnect)

GET /v1/catalogue/rows -> personalised rows
POST /v1/playback/{titleId} -> manifest URL + licence
PUT /v1/progress/{titleId} {positionSec}

WebSocket /v1/docs/{id}: op {baseVersion, ops} -> ack {version}
Server broadcast: transformed ops + presence (cursors)
GET /v1/docs/{id}/versions; POST /v1/docs/{id}/restore {version}

POST /v1/files/{path}/commit {chunkHashes} -> missing chunk list
PUT /v1/chunks/{hash} (presigned) ; GET /v1/chunks/{hash}
POST /v1/shares {path, user, role}

POST /v1/metrics (batched samples: name, labels, ts, value)
GET /v1/query?expr=&from&to&step -> series
PUT /v1/alerts/{id} {expr, for, notify}

GET /v1/sale/{itemId} -> static page from CDN + stock hint
POST /v1/reservations {itemId, qty} (token from waiting room) -> reservationId (expires)
POST /v1/orders {reservationId, paymentId}

SMTP inbound on port 25 (SPF, DKIM, DMARC checks)
GET /v1/mailboxes/inbox?cursor= -> message headers; GET /v1/messages/{id}
POST /v1/messages/send -> queued; GET /v1/search?q=
